  "notes": "Reacher CM Dev 26.11.1-dev.7, a pre-release built from the fork's main.\n\nNew since v26.11.1-dev.6:\n\n- Session types grouped in the session editor\n- Right-click menus in the full-pane file manager\n- ZMODEM: buttons, folders\n- Tunnels through saved SSH sessions\n- GNOME Remote Login over RDP\n- FreeRDP on X11\n- SSH key passphrases with Windows Hello and macOS Touch ID\n- FreeRDP for saved RDP sessions\n- Forward lock key presses in RDP sessions\n\niPhone and iPad: add https://raw.githubusercontent.com/rsipka/ReacherCM/update-feed/apps.json as a source in LiveContainer to get updates.\nFull list of changes: https://github.com/rsipka/ReacherCM/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
